    "media:imagetext": "At Norld Premiere by\nPan American Word Airways\nfirst.\nTO ORDER\nAND TO FLY\nTHE NEW\nDOUBLE\nDECKED\nClipper\n• Here is the first true interconti-\nnental liner of the Air Age. Five\nyears of development lie back of this\nhuge, 70-ton luxury airplane. She\nand her sister ships will cut the San\nFrancisco-Honolulu flight-time from\n12 hours to 9... New York to Lon-\ndon from 14 hours to 12 and New\nYork to Rio from 25¼ hours to 18.\nIn this great, new, \"all-weather\"\nairplane, cabin air is changed every\n90 seconds... at 25,000 feet you\nget low-altitude cabin comfort. For\nthe first time in the Air Age, Pan\nAmerican has put luxury on wings!\nWORLD'S MOST\nEXPERIENCED AIRLINE\nClub lounge on lower deck. Here you have your choice of liquid\nrefreshments includine hot coffee or tea. freshlv made on board\nNote stewardess serving from the compact, modern bar in\nback of the stairway. Each of 14 restful seats has a special glass-\nholder. hult into the arm. Here's a nace where von can meet\npeople, walk around and admire the view out of large windows.\n53\n\"America\"\nHere's the first of 20 new,\n75-passenger Clippers-the largest, fastest,\nmost powerful... and most comfortable\nairliners in the world!\nA small coation of the hue S\npassenger main cabin of the Clipper\nAmerica\n. Note how much\nroom there s for roamine around\nNote big, generous lounging seats.\nAt far left, a passenger is coming\nup trom the lower-acca club lounge\nBig, roomy berths-seven inches wider and four inches\nlonger than in a railroad sleeping car! You have curtains\nfor brivacy on boln upper and lower bertos. Mattresses\nare foam-soft... and you can enjoy breaklast in bed\nSTAIRWAY\nX-ray view. A Stateroom (4 berths or 8 scats) ... can be reserved as a\nunit. B-Washrooms. C-53\nlounge seats in these two sections. D-14\nluxury-type berths. E-Holds for cargo and mail. -Club lounge.",
